{"title": "Amanita Szarr", "pageid": 22383, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Amanita_Szarr", "categories": ["Mentioned characters", "Characters", "Vampires", "Authors"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox noexcerpt searchaux pi-background pi-theme-default pi-layout-default pi-type-creature\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title\" data-source=\"name\">Amanita Szarr</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"title\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Lady Incognita</div>\n</div><figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Portrait Custom.png\">\n\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png 1x, /w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Portrait Custom.png\" width=\"152\" height=\"152\">\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"full name\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Full Name</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Amanita Szarr</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"family\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Family</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cazador_Szarr\" title=\"Cazador Szarr\">Cazador Szarr</a> (Uncle)<br>Fistula (Grandmother)<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br>Dralia (Great-aunt)<br>Blovart (Cousin)<br>Donnela Szarr</div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occupation\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Writer</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vampire\" title=\"Vampire\">Vampire</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Vampire_Spawn\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vampire Spawn\">Vampire Spawn</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n\n<p><b>Amanita Szarr</b>, later known as <i>Lady Incognita</i>, was a prolific author on vampiric matters.  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Although Amanita is not encountered in any playthrough, the party can find her personal journals inside <a href=\"/wiki/Cazador%27s_Palace\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Cazador's Palace\">Cazador's Palace</a>. According to these notes, she was brought to the palace at thirteen years old and introduced to the ballroom for the first time.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> She was later transformed into a <a href=\"/wiki/Vampire\" title=\"Vampire\">Vampire</a>, but refused to participate in what she called <i>the family rites</i>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> In punishment she was imprisoned in the attic.<sup id=\"cite_ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> Amanita rejected the name of Amanita Szarr after her damnation. She renamed herself <i>Lady Incognita</i>, and elected to remain in the attic.<sup id=\"cite_ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> The party can find some of the books Amanita wrote under her new name.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Literature_by_Lady_Incognita\">Literature by Lady Incognita</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Diseases_of_the_Blood\" title=\"Diseases of the Blood\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d1/Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d1/Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d1/Book_Generic_K_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Diseases_of_the_Blood\" title=\"Diseases of the Blood\">Diseases of the Blood</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Tourmaline_Depths\" title=\"The Tourmaline Depths\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Generic_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"a